      "participant": "child",
      "from": 336,
      "to": 494,
      "type": "external"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Plaintext leaves exactly once",
      "items": [
        "plaintext goes into the child's environment, never the caller's stdout",
        "the caller receives masked output",
        "the masker matches across read chunks, holding back until the window is long enough"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Authorization precedes decryption",
      "items": [
        "token scope and reveal policy are decided before decryption",
        "so an out-of-scope reference never produces plaintext at all",
        "with a scoped token, run --with on an out-of-scope entry exits 8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The exit code is a contract",
      "items": [
        "run is a transparent wrapper: a child exiting 42 makes akey exit 42",
        "killed by a signal becomes 128 + signal (unix)",
        "the caller's error handling depends on it"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
